    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMDCx--YzQkM",
      "content": "You know it should be a pretty simple move going to a one story house confidentially you've been here to the apartment complex where we live. So I would appreciate if you know, tell anybody at this location yet that we're moving out. But yeah, I think the price looks pretty good. I was surprised that it's only two guys but they can get it done in four or five hours. I'm sure.",
